  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Adjustable Sights" id="4565-e3f5-c290-9d99" hidden="false">
      <description>When performing an Attack with this Weapon Profile, if the Targeted Unit is within half of this Weapon&apos;s Range Value, this Unit get +1 to hit with this Weapon.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Stahlschutz" id="7498-ac28-f25d-82d8" hidden="false">
      <description>After activating this ability, all allied Troop Units that are within 20&quot; of a (CORE) Zeppelin model may activate their Shield Generators one additional time this round.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Shield Generator" id="344f-2329-dd70-0840" hidden="false">
      <description>Each Unit in this army may choose to Activate their Shield Generator once per Round when they are selected as the target of a Ranged Attack. When they do, they gain the following benefits until the Attack is resolved.


Non vehicle units:
• Reduce the number of Hits of all incoming Weapon Profiles by 1.
• If this Unit has not Activated this Round it may spend any number of its Actions for the
turn to reduce the Hits by an additional 1 per action spent.
• Bulwark 1


Vehicle Units:
• Reduce the A.P. of all incoming Weapon Profiles by 2.
• If this Unit has not Activated this Round it may spend any number of it’s Actions for the
turn to reduce the A.P. by an additional 1 per action spent.
• Bulwark 3


Hits, Range, and A.P. may be decreased only to a minimum of 1.
These rules do not apply to Weapons with the Flames or Gas Special Rules.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Last Rites" id="df4a-8cf6-7abf-20d7" hidden="false">
      <description>After this Unit has destroyed an Enemy Unit, it may, as a Standard Action, perform Last Rites for the fallen. For every two times Last Rites are performed, gain 1 VP.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Looming Behemoth" id="b8d4-80df-e25c-9274" hidden="false">
      <description>Until the end of this round, any time an Enemy Unit attempts to capture an Objective with 20&quot; of a (CORE) Zeppelin model, they must roll a 6+ Check, on failure, the action fails.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Edelweiss" id="bdad-06f8-da0d-efe2" hidden="false">
      <description>If this Unit is Flying, Embarked in a Flying Transport, or at least 3&quot; above a Unit they Target for a Ranged Attack, their Weapons gain the Close In Special Rule until the Attack is resolved.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
