          <rules>
            <rule name="The Kaiser&apos;s Bidding" id="a3ba-7973-9faa-886f" hidden="false">
              <description>At the end of the first Setup Phase, select one Enemy Command or Hero Model and designate them as an Enemy of the State. When a designated Model is eliminated by Franz Von Trotta&apos;s Unit, you gain one Victory Point (VP).  If Franz Von Trotta is your Field Commander, when an Enemy of the State is Eliminated, select a new Model to be designated.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Pet Pseudodrachen" id="ae10-a999-c0c4-e875" hidden="false">
              <description>At the end of Franz Von Trotta&apos;s activation, his pet Pseudodrachen Stefan applies one Suppression to one Enemy Unit within 20&quot;.</description>
            </rule>
