                <cost name="Supply" typeId="284c-5503-e866-a2e0" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Intel" typeId="2f82-38f2-c47a-db0a" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Activations" typeId="a4ae-e848-77a7-6d45" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="The Kaiser&apos;s Hand" id="75c0-019c-75a5-1887" hidden="false">
                  <description>During the Command Phase, before Orders are Issued, you may spend 1 Intel, if you do, select a rule from the list below, this Unit gains that effect for the remainder of the Round, or until this Model is destroyed.

* Interception: At the beginning of the Action Phase, select an Enemy Unit within 24&quot; and Line of Sight, remove all Order Tokens on that Unit, this Unit may gain one of them.

* Jumbled Static: Whenever an Enemy Unit within the Radio Network is issued an Order, roll 1d10, on a 7+, that Order is not issued.

* De Jure Territory: As an Action, select an uncontested Objective Marker within 24&quot; and Line of Sight, this Unit immediately Captures that Objective.

* Singled Out: Immediately select an Enemy Unit within LoS and 16&quot;, it can no longer benefit from Rules and Abilities originating from other Units.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntry>
